     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet hn-vs-41cb9f76208c</b></p><a name=\"hn-vs-41cb9f76208c\"> </a><a name=\"hchn-vs-41cb9f76208c\"> </a><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-hn-answer.html\"><code>http://ltc-ig.fhir.tw/CodeSystem/hn-answer</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version ?1.1.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-hn-answer.html#hn-answer-cb3a0bd0ea486\">cb3a0bd0ea486</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">可獨立處理財務(指到郵局(銀行)提存款、支付房租、帳單、給錢、找錢等)。</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-hn-answer.html#hn-answer-cc0ad0f856896\">cc0ad0f856896</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">可以處理日常的購買（給錢、找錢），但需要別人協助與銀行往來或大宗買賣。</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-hn-answer.html#hn-answer-ca01dc982de31\">ca01dc982de31</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">完全不能處理錢財。</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
